                            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                              <li class="si__list--single">
                                Ability to apply in-depth problem solving and
                                programming skills to design and implement
                                efficient software solutions.
                              </li>
                              <li class="si__list--single">
                                Ability to collaboratively develop software
                                solutions for trans-disciplinary engineering
                                problems using modern tools and frameworks.
                              </li>
                              <li class="si__list--single">
                                Ability to design and integrate hardware and
                                software components for the advancement of
                                computing technology.
                              </li>
                            </ul>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
